---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageIntro from "@/components/PageIntro.astro";
import { site } from "@/data/site";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Dino’s Lab is a small electronics studio in Ladispoli, near Rome, with assembly at Acme Systems."
>
  <div class="shell py-16 lg:py-20">
    <PageIntro kicker="About" title="Who we are">
      A small electronics studio in Ladispoli, just outside Rome.
    </PageIntro>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-muted lg:col-span-7">
        <p>
          We design printed circuit boards, write firmware, and take care of
          the software around the hardware. For each job we pull in people we
          already work with — software, firmware, mechanics — as needed.
        </p>
        <p>
          A lot of PCB consultancies stop at Gerbers and a far-away fab. We
          have a production agreement with{" "}
          <a class="text-ink underline decoration-line underline-offset-2 hover:text-lab" href={site.acme.url}>
            {site.acme.name}
          </a>
          , also in Ladispoli. Pick-and-place, vapour-phase reflow, through-hole,
          test: the same line they use for their own modules, including the
          RoadRunner. That’s where Dino’s Lab boards get built, ten pieces or
          ten thousand.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our own modules are next. Until they exist, the work is custom.
          English is fine, and so is working at a distance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <dl class="h-fit divide-y divide-line border border-line bg-panel lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm">
          <dt class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Studio</dt>
          <dd>{site.location}</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm">
          <dt class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Production</dt>
          <dd>{site.acme.name}, Ladispoli</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm">
          <dt class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">GitHub</dt>
          <dd>
            <a class="hover:text-lab" href={site.github}>{site.githubHandle}</a>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-sm">
          <dt class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Email</dt>
          <dd>
            <a class="hover:text-lab" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
